{"id":"memorial_105003","cat":"memorial","group":{"id":"memorial105000","label":"Data · I Don't Just Tell Anyone.wav"},"label":"Stick With the Big Dog.wav","stage":null,"prev":"memorial_105002","next":"memorial_105004","speakers":{},"icons":{},"lines":[{"id":"memorial_105003_1","type":"Speech","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_Memorial:memorial_50_03_description","text":"By now, you should have a rough idea that the Outer Rim ain't anything like the Ark."},{"id":"memorial_105003_2","type":"Speech","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_Memorial:memorial_50_03_description","text":"Let your guard down for even a second, and you're toast."},{"id":"memorial_105003_3","type":"Speech","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_Memorial:memorial_50_03_description","text":"You've gotta keep your wits about you just to survive."},{"id":"memorial_105003_4","type":"Speech","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_Memorial:memorial_50_03_description","text":"What about when you sleep, you ask?"},{"id":"memorial_105003_5","type":"Speech","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_Memorial:memorial_50_03_description","text":"Good question!"},{"id":"memorial_105003_6","type":"Speech","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_Memorial:memorial_50_03_description","text":"That's when you stick close to the big dog, even while you sleep."},{"id":"memorial_105003_7","type":"Speech","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_Memorial:memorial_50_03_description","text":"What if the big guy bullies you?"},{"id":"memorial_105003_8","type":"Speech","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_Memorial:memorial_50_03_description","text":"Easy. While you're awake, you've gotta stay on their good side—flatter them, bring them gifts, whatever it takes."},{"id":"memorial_105003_9","type":"Speech","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_Memorial:memorial_50_03_description","text":"Huh? How do you find someone strong?"},{"id":"memorial_105003_10","type":"Speech","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_Memorial:memorial_50_03_description","text":"Haha. Just keep your eyes open, and you'll spot 'em."},{"id":"memorial_105003_11","type":"Speech","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_Memorial:memorial_50_03_description","text":"Think you're the only one here who wants a good night's sleep?"},{"id":"memorial_105003_12","type":"Speech","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_Memorial:memorial_50_03_description","text":"Everyone else wants it too."},{"id":"memorial_105003_13","type":"Speech","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_Memorial:memorial_50_03_description","text":"So what happens then?"},{"id":"memorial_105003_14","type":"Speech","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_Memorial:memorial_50_03_description","text":"Yep, they all flock to the strong guy."},{"id":"memorial_105003_15","type":"Speech","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_Memorial:memorial_50_03_description","text":"So you just line up where the crowd goes and follow suit."},{"id":"memorial_105003_16","type":"Speech","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_Memorial:memorial_50_03_description","text":"Ah, who am I sucking up to?"},{"id":"memorial_105003_17","type":"Speech","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_Memorial:memorial_50_03_description","text":"Haha... that's a secret!"}]}